    "body": "## Summary\n\n`FluxEncoderConfig.autoencoder_path` and `Inference.prompts_path` still defaulted to `torchtitan/experiments/flux/...`. That tree is gone. Shipped recipes already override both fields:\n\n- `autoencoder_path=\"assets/hf/FLUX.1-dev/ae.safetensors\"` in `torchtitan_recipes/models/flux.py` and `torchtitan_recipes/tests/models/flux.py`\n- `prompts_path=\"./torchtitan/models/flux/inference/prompts.txt\"` in `torchtitan_recipes/tests/models/flux.py`\n\nAnyone who builds `FluxEncoderConfig()` or `Inference()` without a recipe opens a missing path. `torchtitan/models/flux/inference/infer.py` reads `config.inference.prompts_path` directly. The prompts file shipped in-tree is `torchtitan/models/flux/inference/prompts.txt`. `ae.safetensors` is a user download and is not in git; the default only names the same path the recipes already use.\n\nThe example comment in `torchtitan/models/flux/run_infer.sh` pointed at `./torchtitan/models/flux/run_train.sh`, which does not exist. It now points at the repo-root `./run_train.sh`.\n\nRecipe overrides are unchanged.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `pytest tests/unit_tests/cpu/test_flux_default_asset_paths.py tests/unit_tests/cpu/test_flux_inference.py`\n- [ ] Confirm `torchtitan_recipes/models/flux.py` and `torchtitan_recipes/tests/models/flux.py` still pass the same path strings\n",
